{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Runemaster Elemental Carvings unleashes a random carving from Fist of the Ancients (#973)",
  "contract": [
    "Tooltip 705618: Fist of the Ancients unleashes an elemental carving at random: Fire Carving 706520 (+15% armor",
    "penetration, 6 sec), Water Carving 707142 ($707142o1 mana over 6 sec), Earth Carving 712300 ($712356s1% (3%)",
    "missing health every $712300T1 sec for 6 sec) or Air Carving 653253 (+10% melee haste, 6 sec).",
    "705618 effect 0 is PROC_TRIGGER_SPELL 712327; Spell.dbc gives it ProcFlags 0, so no proc entry existed.",
    "Fist of the Ancients ranks (712326, 712330-712335, 712355) are the melee-class family 38 spells with mask2",
    "0x8000; the only other two, buff 712403 and Genesis 500502, are triggered and cannot proc on cast.",
    "712327 is Ascension effect 184 (trigger random spell) with a server-side group id, which the core left as",
    "EffectNULL; each cast must unleash exactly one of the four carvings, uniformly at random.",
    "32 casts leave a given carving unused with probability 0.75^32 (1e-4), so every carving must appear.",
    "Earth Carving's heal 712356 is HEAL_PCT with MiscValueB 1, Ascension's missing-health marker: at 50000 of",
    "100000 health its first tick restores 3% of the missing 50000 (1500), not 3% of maximum health (3000).",
    "A Runemaster without the talent unleashes no carving. Weapon skills and Dual Wield are fixture setup."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 180000,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "rm", "race": 1, "class": 32, "level": 80, "melee_hit_rating": 10000, "spell_hit_rating": 10000,
      "expertise_rating": 10000, "allow_regeneration": false
